# Keep the build context to sources only: everything the image needs is restored
# or compiled inside the SDK stage. A stray bin/ or obj/ from a Windows host
# poisons the Linux build with the wrong RID assets.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/
artifacts/

.git/
.github/
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/

**/*.user
**/TestResults/
coverage/

README.md
LICENSE
compose*.yaml
.gitignore
.dockerignore
